OL,3,AZimbabwe tycoon Wicknell Chivayo and
OL,4,Awife killed in helicopter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FProminent Zimbabwean businessman
OL,7,FWicknell Chivayo and his wife have been
OL,8,Fkilled in a helicopter crash that left
OL,9,Fsix people dead, his family have
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FThe helicopter came down in the
OL,13,FMarondera rural area, about 70km (43
OL,14,Fmiles) east of the capital, Harare, on
OL,15,FWednesday evening. Police said all six
OL,16,Fpeople on board died.
OL,18,FFamily spokesperson Herbert Chivayo
OL,19,Fconfirmed the deaths of the 43-year-old
OL,20,Fbusinessman and his wife Lucy Muteke to
OL,21,Fstate broadcaster ZBC, saying the
OL,22,Ffamily was devastated by the tragedy.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
