OL,3,AZimbabwe tycoon Wicknell Chivayo and
OL,4,Awife killed in helicopter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FChivayo was known for his lavish
OL,7,Flifestyle, close ties to some African
OL,8,Fpresidents and lucrative government
OL,9,Fcontracts that had repeatedly attracted
OL,10,Fscrutiny.
